WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.599
Your documents, searchable and explained — 100 % local.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:13.599
Open Library and add a folder: every document appears with its location.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:20.600
Search words, phrases, prefix* and AND / OR / NOT; filter by type, size and location.

00:00:21.399 --> 00:00:27.600
Tick the files you need and create a reusable group — your index for a task.

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:34.600
RAG-CARTA summarizes, extracts or synthesizes — every answer cites its sources.

00:00:35.399 --> 00:00:41.600
Everything also works from the command line — and as a portable app.

